# OPEN HOUSE: a Random list deals two stars and eleven other guests (plus
# neighbours and cousins); buying every neighbour gives them real names.
game openhouse
wait 5
cheat new 6 1
expect npool == 15
expect poolstars == 2
cheat new 1 1
cheat pop 100
cheat shop 0
cheat shop 0
cheat shop 0
expect named == 0
cheat shop 0
expect named == 4
